      "body": {
        "en": [
          "We design and make high-quality kitchens, cabinetry and interior pieces that fit seamlessly into your space and your style. With an eye for detail, true craftsmanship and the finest materials, we create timeless interiors where form, function and experience come together.",
          "Over the years Flowwood has worked for a broad range of clients, from private homeowners with a dream kitchen to architects and property developers in search of perfect bespoke work."
        ],
        "nl": [
          "We ontwerpen en maken hoogwaardige keukens, kastenwerk en interieurstukken die naadloos aansluiten bij je ruimte en je stijl. Met oog voor detail, echt vakmanschap en de beste materialen creëren we tijdloze interieurs waar vorm, functie en beleving samenkomen.",
